@DotnetPdfGen.Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5134

### List sample templates
GET {{DotnetPdfGen.Web_HostAddress}}/api/samples

### Render a sample with its bundled data
GET {{DotnetPdfGen.Web_HostAddress}}/api/samples/invoice/pdf

### Render the invoice from a typed C# model
GET {{DotnetPdfGen.Web_HostAddress}}/api/examples/invoice?paid=false

### Render an ad-hoc template
POST {{DotnetPdfGen.Web_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<h1>Hello {{name}}</h1>{{#each items}}<p>{{this}}</p>{{/each}}",
  "css": "h1 { color: #1f4e79; }",
  "data": { "name": "Ada", "items": ["One", "Two"] },
  "page": { "size": "Letter", "orientation": "Landscape", "marginMm": 15 }
}

### Preview the bound HTML without rendering
POST {{DotnetPdfGen.Web_HostAddress}}/api/pdf/html
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<p>{{greeting}}, {{name}}!</p>",
  "data": { "greeting": "Hi", "name": "Grace" }
}

###
